* Remove copyright notices or ownership information.

## 6. Confidentiality

Users must protect confidential company information and comply with all applicable confidentiality obligations.

## 7. Version Control

All modifications must be tracked through Git and follow the company's branching, review, and approval workflow.

## 8. Termination

Upon termination of employment or authorization, users must immediately cease access to this repository and return or delete company information as required by company policy.

